msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "はじめに"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:9
msgid ""
"Learn what you need to start using saealib and how to run a simple "
"optimization."
msgstr "saealibを使い始めるための準備と簡単な実行方法を紹介します。"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:11
msgid "Start with the basics"
msgstr "基本情報"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:13
msgid "Start here for installation and a simple implementation."
msgstr "まずはここから始めましょう。"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:19
msgid "What is saealib?"
msgstr "{fa}`circle-info;sd-mr-1` saealibとは"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:22
msgid "Learn saealib's purpose and overall structure."
msgstr "saealibの目的と全体像を確認します。"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:25
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "{fa}`download;sd-mr-1` インストール"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:28
msgid "Install saealib in your environment."
msgstr "saealibを環境に導入します。"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "{fa}`rocket;sd-mr-1` クイックスタート"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:34
msgid "Run your first optimization."
msgstr "最初の最適化を実行します。"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:39
msgid "Choose how to use saealib"
msgstr "saealibの使い方を選ぶ"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:41
msgid ""
"saealib offers four ways to work, depending on how much of the "
"configuration you assemble yourself."
msgstr "saealibには、自分で組み立てる構成の量に応じて4つの使い方があります。"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid "Layer"
msgstr "レイヤー"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使い方"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid "First step"
msgstr "最初のステップ"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid "Layer 1: Use"
msgstr "Layer 1: Use"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid ""
"Run an optimization with the defaults. Define a problem and pass it to "
"`minimize()` or `maximize()`."
msgstr "既定の構成で最適化を実行します。問題を定義し、`minimize()`または`maximize()`に渡します。"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid "[Quickstart](quickstart.md), [Tutorials](../tutorials/index.md)"
msgstr "[クイックスタート](quickstart.md)、[チュートリアル](../tutorials/index.md)"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid "Layer 2: Compose"
msgstr "Layer 2: Compose"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid ""
"Choose built-in components and combine them with `Optimizer`. Reproduce "
"algorithms from the literature."
msgstr "ビルトインコンポーネントを選び、`Optimizer`と組み合わせます。文献にあるアルゴリズムも再現できます。"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid ""
"[Optimization components](../concepts/index.md), "
"[Algorithms](../algorithms/index.md)"
msgstr "[Optimizationコンポーネント](../concepts/index.md)、[アルゴリズム](../algorithms/index.md)"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid "Layer 3: Extend Components"
msgstr "Layer 3: Extend Components"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid ""
"Replace an existing responsibility with a custom implementation by "
"subclassing an abstract base."
msgstr "抽象基底クラスを継承し、既存の責務を独自実装に置き換えます。"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid "[Implement a custom component](../tutorials/custom_components.md)"
msgstr "[独自Componentを実装する](../tutorials/custom_components.md)"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid "Layer 4: Extend Framework"
msgstr "Layer 4: Extend Framework"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid "Extend the meaning of contracts, graphs, compilers, and execution itself."
msgstr "契約、グラフ、コンパイラ、実行そのものの意味を拡張します。"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:31
msgid "[Framework extensions](../framework/extensions.md)"
msgstr "[フレームワーク拡張](../framework/extensions.md)"

#: ../../getting_started/index.md:50
msgid ""
"Start at Layer 1 and move down the layers when the defaults no longer "
"cover your needs. To choose a layer by the part you want to change, see "
"[Choosing an extension point](../concepts/extension_guidelines.md)."
msgstr ""
"Layer "
"1から始め、既定値で足りない場合に下位のLayerへ進みます。変更したい部分からLayerを選ぶ場合は、[拡張点の選び方](../concepts/extension_guidelines.md)を参照してください。"
